    imageSourceLabel="Amazon"
    imageSourceUrl="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CZDTYZ13?tag=deskrespawn-20"
    productMeta="Amazon ASIN B0CZDTYZ13"
    tags={['Budget tech','Best under $25']}
    why="Most power strips are cramped and useless once you plug in anything bulky."
    tradeoff="This one actually leaves enough space for big plugs. I’ve bought this same power strip three times for different rooms. The spacing, flat plug, and built-in USB ports make it easy to justify every time."
